{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:44:06+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Detective - The Test", "steam_appid": 3473570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>🕵️‍♀️The detective has done their part. Now it’s the forensic team’s turn.🧪</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473570/extras/0e62aaaff52776141f361be0a50ff4de.avif?t=1779953365\" width=1536 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FORENSIC – M.E. Protocol</strong> shifts the focus of investigation games, moving away from dialogue-based deduction toward hands-on <strong>crime scene analysis</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t just question suspects, you’ll examine the environment and collect every piece of evidence needed to reconstruct what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473570/extras/58c13d579498d89346c910580b53767e.avif?t=1779953365\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>nine cases</strong> presents a different scenario, ranging from violent confrontations to incidents that appear to be accidents. Nothing is explained in advance. You arrive at the scene, study the details, and determine the truth for yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no time limits to pressure you and no predetermined solutions. In FORENSIC – M.E. Protocol, you take the time to catalogue evidence, review clues, and carefully piece together the sequence of events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add Forensic M.E. Protocol to your Steam Wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473570/extras/0e62aaaff52776141f361be0a50ff4de.avif?t=1779953365\" width=1536 height=496 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be a great detective? In <i>DETECTIVE – The Test</i>, you will face three intriguing cases where only your observation skills and logical thinking will lead you to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crime scenes, analyze the connections between the people involved, and answer key questions: Who is the victim? Who is the culprit? When did the crime take place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no easy clues or shortcuts, only you and your deduction skills. Take notes, connect the dots, and uncover the truth in three distinct locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caravan park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coffee shop hiding secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? The truth is waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic deduction experience with no hints or hand-holding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique cases, each with its own story and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe, analyze, and answer critical questions to crack the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive experience that challenges your logic and critical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for true fans of detective challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth, or will the mystery remain unsolved?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be a great detective? In <i>DETECTIVE – The Test</i>, you will face three intriguing cases where only your observation skills and logical thinking will lead you to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crime scenes, analyze the connections between the people involved, and answer key questions: Who is the victim? Who is the culprit? When did the crime take place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no easy clues or shortcuts, only you and your deduction skills. Take notes, connect the dots, and uncover the truth in three distinct locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caravan park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coffee shop hiding secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? The truth is waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic deduction experience with no hints or hand-holding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique cases, each with its own story and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe, analyze, and answer critical questions to crack the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive experience that challenges your logic and critical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for true fans of detective challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth, or will the mystery remain unsolved?</p>", "short_description": "Test your detective instincts across three challenging cases. No hints, no help—just you, your intuition, and your ability to piece together the truth. Can you solve the mystery?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473570/cc055d326f74f11f6c6def79b008e737d05df748/header.jpg?t=1779953365", "capsule_image": "https:/